---
const projects = [
  { number: '01', name: 'Linaje Bendito', image: '/images/projects/linaje-bendito.jpg', alt: 'Linaje Bendito project preview', description: 'A warm, editorial storefront concept for a brand with a strong sense of place and story.', tech: ['Astro', 'CSS', 'JavaScript'], github: true },
  { number: '02', name: 'Personal Portfolio', image: '/images/projects/portfolio.jpg', alt: 'Personal portfolio project preview', description: 'A living digital notebook for showing work, learning in public, and finding the next interesting problem.', tech: ['HTML', 'CSS', 'Astro'], github: true },
  { number: '03', name: 'Business Website', image: '/images/projects/business.jpg', alt: 'Business website project preview', description: 'A clear, confident web presence that helps a growing business turn attention into conversations.', tech: ['Figma', 'JavaScript', 'Vercel'], github: false }
];
---
<section class="section section-shell" id="projects" data-reveal>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">A few things made</div><h2>Selected <span>projects.</span></h2></div><p>Some real and imagined work, all built around the same goal: make the digital part feel human.</p></div>
  <div class="project-list">{projects.map((project) => <article class="project-card glass"><div class="project-media"><img src={project.image} alt={project.alt} width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="project-info"><div class="project-meta"><span>Case study / {project.number}</span><span>2026</span></div><h3>{project.name}</h3><p>{project.description}</p><div class="tech-list">{project.tech.map((technology) => <span>{technology}</span>)}</div><div class="project-links"><a href="#contact">View project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{project.github && <a href="https://github.com/USERNAME" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}</div></div></article>)}</div>
</section>
